  "source_order": "User direction governs. U06 supersedes numeric dispatch tiers with separate High/Medium/Low severity and priority, High-triggered Astra ownership, Sol-led Medium work and deferred Low observations. U05 retains no active workflow changes; U04/U03 preserve maintainability learning, adversarial review, maximum-five batches and Git traceability. R06 approves v6 only. V7 requires its own independent verdict. Frozen source bytes and remaining safeguards are preserved."
